\" >In response, many of the Free Cities, united under the banner of the Combined Order, sent their armies to confront this terrible threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But victory was not to be theirs, for while the khraiax stood little chance against the might of the combined forces, a far greater danger rose from beneath the city\u2019s streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vahrin\u2019s king lies dead, along with thousands of soldiers who marched to the city\u2019s aid. Now only its most stalwart defenders remain, desperately fighting to reclaim their beloved home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/277c0b20df931165d4c7b0cb68da053b.poster.avif?t=1768584385\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/277c0b20df931165d4c7b0cb68da053b.webm?t=1768584385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/4ba91c0ce7ed2e133faab236a270e486.avif?t=1768584385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras_big/4ba91c0ce7ed2e133faab236a270e486.webp?t=1768584385 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vahrin\u2019s Call stands as its own complete tale, yet it forms just one part of a sweeping epic narrative that spans nations and continents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as smaller, isolated struggles becomes part of a greater saga, where every character\u2019s trial, every kingdom\u2019s war, and every act of courage or betrayal weaves the tapestry of the unfolding story throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/3977124f25d053f5ddc9f7047a192528.poster.avif?t=1768584385\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/3977124f25d053f5ddc9f7047a192528.webm?t=1768584385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras/335d8484785873ea1a2ce92e1f0a8187.avif?t=1768584385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/extras_big/335d8484785873ea1a2ce92e1f0a8187.webp?t=1768584385 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 An entirely original, handcrafted high fantasy universe (No generative AI).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rid the Vale of Vahrin of the many vicious threats that plague it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Seek out the many puzzles, challenges and secrets hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customise your armour, weapons, spells, potions, traps and everything else at your disposal to develop your ideal playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Large array of character creation options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Full voice acting (English) (No generative AI).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Full controller support.</p>","developers":["Titan Roc"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951770/ac5